{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07879","headline":"和宋太史北楼新亭 · 孟浩然","name":"和宋太史北楼新亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"返耕意未遂，日夕登城隅。\n谁道山林近，坐爲符竹拘。\n丽谯非改作，轩槛是新图。\n远水自嶓冢，长云吞具区。\n愿随江燕贺，羞逐府僚趋。\n欲识狂歌者，丘园一竖儒。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟浩然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07879.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07879","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}